Scoped xstack video filter

The option table (inputs, layout, grid, shortest, fill), the init checks
(layout with grid, the inputs=2 default grid, grid input count), the
query_formats list without fill, the grid and layout placement of
config_output (w<i>/h<i>/decimal sums, av_image_fill_linesizes x offsets,
AV_CEIL_RSHIFT y offsets, bounding-box output size), the framesync
configuration (sync=1, EXT_STOP before, EXT_INFINITY or EXT_STOP after) and
the plane copies of process_frame/process_slice in src/video-xstack.ts and
src/video-ops/xstack.ts follow libavfilter/vf_stack.c (xstack_options, init,
query_formats, config_output, process_frame, process_slice).
